# Per-user cargo overrides (e.g., shared target-dir paths) — see
# .cargo/config.toml comments. Cargo auto-merges config.toml + config.toml.local
# style layering is not native, but users can copy their local config via
# CARGO_HOME/config.toml or a symlink; we gitignore the path to prevent
# accidental commits of absolute per-developer paths (#8860).
.cargo/config.toml.local

