# Eval outputs. The bulky per-instance jsonl / model dumps stay ignored, but the
# small `scoreboard.json` files are KEPT: they are the entire evidence chain for
# a claimed division result, and ignoring them is how the SQ and UC QF_Datatypes
# win artifacts vanished (see the development design notes).
# The re-include needs the `**/` line too — git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so the directories must be un-excluded before a file inside can be.
evals/**/results/**
!evals/**/results/**/
!evals/**/results/**/scoreboard.json
evals/**/logs/

