# Corpus guard. The BASELINE is committed -- it is the shared contract, and a
# change of expectations should be a reviewable diff. These two are NOT:
#   the development design notes          per-run logs and JSON, machine-local
#   the development design notes  the local measurement series; appended every
#     run, so tracking it would leave the tree dirty every single morning and
#     turn an ordinary rebase into a conflict. Commit it deliberately if you
#     want the trend shared.
the development design notes
the development design notes
